{"ts":"2026-09-25T13:01:38.680Z","author":"harness","name":"harness/00000053","body":{"seq":53,"kind":"tool_request","turn":"ec94ce5d929f4722be27076be155ab6e","tool_id":"toolu_01MHQWA2b5Pkvn7Q6Z4wkWWo","name":"mcp__nimoi__fs_read","arguments":{"path":"origins/onboarding_1.12.md"},"allowed":true}}
